{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE JUNGLE CALLS... DO YOU ANSWER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.poster.avif?t=1755470863\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.webm?t=1755470863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/b3eb8da9d58d4e56e4f50f0bbfa0d281.mp4?t=1755470863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a fluid momentum based movement system. Live the fantasy of ape-ing out at maximum speed, with no movement speed limit.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize a wide variety of movement mechanics and parkour moves: Dash, Slide, Dive, Slam or combine them all with the Monkey developed Banan-Bomb technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete with fellow apes, top the scoreboards and become the alpha primate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.poster.avif?t=1755470863\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.webm?t=1755470863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/373e2ed780647eef1476777a7d9cd12f.mp4?t=1755470863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Operate an epic fecal-fueled arsenal of primal weapons to deliver dopamine straight to your primate dome.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blitz your way through destructible environments and lay waste to Tiki Cults, Cybernetic Armies and Ancient Beings.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhance your Ape with black market serums and rare artifacts, to create your very own monkey build.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.poster.avif?t=1755470863\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.webm?t=1755470863\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/extras/04d51e828936932c6f20b1e95b3e0da4.mp4?t=1755470863\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a Chimp crusade to far away lands, including Lush Jungles, Ancient Temples, Neon Cityscapes and bonus Hidden Realms. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make friends with the locals, relax on Ape Island and catch some fish for a nice Monkey supper.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to a diverse soundtrack, with synth-wave, bongo beats, rock and more.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>  </i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2124360?t=1755470863","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2124360?t=1755470863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2124360/f4d18d8469bc72bf25b1530bc6939ee9e2ddbba0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755470863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.aka